        "localized_id": null,
        "value": "<h2>FIGHT AS A SPARTAN WARRIOR</h2>Forge your own odyssey in a world on the brink of chaos and become a legendary Spartan hero, fighting mythical creatures along the way. Charge into epic clashes between Sparta and Athens, with battles pitting 150v150 soldiers against each other.<br><h2>TRAVEL TO ANCIENT GREECE</h2>Make your way through wild landscapes, vibrant cities, and iconic historical sites. Sail across shimmering seas, climb towering mountains, and discover the heart of a civilization.<br><h2>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</h2>Your choices shape the world around you. Play in a living world that constantly reacts to your every decision: forge alliances, spark conflicts, and determine the fate of characters. Customize your gear, ship, and special abilities to become a legend.<br>",
